{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":23044987,"ns":0,"title":"Attribute substitution","extract":"Attribute substitution is a psychological process thought to underlie a number of cognitive biases and perceptual illusions. It occurs when an individual has to make a judgment (of a target attribute) that is computationally complex, and instead substitutes a more easily calculated heuristic attribute.","description":"Type of cognitive bias","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}